    title: "What Is Dual Pricing? Complete Guide for Merchants",
    excerpt: "Dual pricing displays two prices — a cash price and a card price — giving customers transparency while reducing your processing costs. Here's how it works.",
    category: "Programs",
    author: "Liberty Bancard Team",
    readTime: "8 min read",
    publishDate: "April 20, 2025",
    publishedISO: "2025-04-20T08:00:00Z",
